            "heading": "<h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl mb-2\">Results You Can Sea<sup>®</sup>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"font-book\">Skin feels replenished and looks visibly smoother from the very first use. In an independent clinical study of 53 women, results were measurable and consistent.</p>",
