    "accordion_bJrxEn": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "item_Mk97cp": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "summary": "Benefits",
            "summary_classes": "py-3",
            "content": "<ul class=\"mb-2 flex gap-2 flex-wrap\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center badge bg-sand-300 text-sand-900\">Glow</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center badge bg-sand-300 text-sand-900\">Firms</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center badge bg-sand-300 text-sand-900\">Moisturizes</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"li:mb-1 mb-2 icon-list bullet\">\n<li>Visibly improves skin elasticity</li>\n<li>Softens, nourishes &amp; visibly firms</li>\n<li>Delivers an all over glow</li>\n<li>Lightweight, fast-absorbing &amp; non-greasy</li>\n</ul>",
            "content_classes": "pb-6 content tracking-wide py-2 max-h-80 overflow-y-auto a:link b:font-bold"
          }
        },
        "item_gwccW3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "summary": "Why You'll Love It",
            "summary_classes": "py-3",
            "content": "<p>Clinically shown to instantly improve the look of skin elasticity and deliver deep moisturization. Our seaweed-infused body oil is a rush of antioxidant-rich hydration that softens, nourishes and firms like no other. Rich yet never greasy, this intoxicating aromatherapy elixir enhances every inch. Also available in a fragrance-free formula, which is hypoallergenic, dermatologist-tested and safe for sensitive skin.</p>",
            "content_classes": "pb-6"
          }
        },
        "item_QPbLpa": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "summary": "Scent Profile",
            "summary_classes": "py-3",
            "content": "<p>Uplifting grapefruit, lime &amp; cypress blended with sweet notes of mango mandarin.</p>",
            "content_classes": "pb-6"
          }
        },
        "item_REYwda": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "summary": "How To Use",
            "summary_classes": "py-3",
            "content": "<table>\n          <tbody>\n<tr class=\"align-top td:pb-2\">\n            <th scope=\"row\" class=\"text-left\"><b class=\"mr-1\">How:</b></th>\n            <td>Massage a generous amount into dry or damp skin.</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"align-top td:pb-2\">\n            <th scope=\"row\" class=\"text-left\"><b class=\"mr-1\">When:</b></th>\n            <td>Use morning and night.</td>\n          </tr>\n<tr class=\"align-top\">\n              <th scope=\"row\" class=\"text-left\"><b class=\"mr-1 whitespace-nowrap\">Pro tip:</b></th>\n              <td>Use alone, or layer over <a href=\"/products/hyaluronic-body-serum\" class=\"link\">Hyaluronic Body Serum</a> or <a href=\"/products/undaria-algae-body-lotion\" class=\"link\">Undaria Algae™ Body Lotion</a> to maximize your skincare results. Can apply over body art to increase vibrancy.</td>\n            </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
            "content_classes": "pb-6"
          }
        },
        "item_tCRmCk": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "summary": "FAQs",
            "summary_classes": "py-3",
            "content": "<div class=\"mb-4\">\n<strong>Is it normal to have sediment at the bottom of my bottle?</strong>\n<p>Yes, this oil contains Undaria seaweed, so naturally occurring sediment may be present at the bottom of the bottle. This is normal and doesn't affect the product's quality or efficacy.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\n<strong>Is it normal to see color variance?</strong>\n<p>Color can range from golden to emerald green due to the artisanal manner of production. This does not impact the quality or efficacy of the product.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Can I use it on my face?</strong>\n<p>This oil has been formulated for use on the body. For your face, try Dayglow Face Oil™.</p>\n</div>",
            "content_classes": "pb-6"
          }
        }
      },
